    "body": "I have more problems with Starship, Fish and Kitty (as pointed out above and [here](https://github.com/kovidgoyal/kitty/issues/2743)\r\nIn the following situations, a new prompt being emitted *where it should not):\r\n\r\n    have text in the prompt line, press escape (vim normal mode)\r\n    paste something from the clipboard\r\n    cancel the command (CTRL + C)\r\n    paste something using a kitten\r\n\r\n<img width=\"724\" alt=\"83947800-96732a00-a819-11ea-9195-4d4ab51c07fe\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7083188/83949672-8103fd00-a825-11ea-892f-c715764a4f6b.png\">\r\n\r\nAccording to kitty, this might have to do with the shell or the prompt.",
