    "body": "@basbebe I can't confirm your initial example on an empty line, but I do see this behavior when pasting in text.\r\n\r\nMy initial suspicion is that starship uses some ANSI control sequences, and that kitty is not compatible with them. I know that without installing some terminfo files, SSH over kitty often completely screws up (this is what forced me to stop using it about a year ago), so it wouldn't surprise me if kitty doesn't interpret certain ANSI controls the same way as other terminals.",
