    "body": "Yes, in fact I remember sweating a lot over that particular line of code. The code mentions a whole slew of issues that were related--let me link them here and then I'll look at them more in-depth.\r\n\r\nWorkaround for bug in fish: #739, #279\r\nBreaks other shells: #808, #824, #834\r\n\r\nEDIT: The escape in question is the \"ANSI Clear to End\" sequence: `<ESC>[J`, where `<ESC>` is the ANSI escape byte.",
