    "updated_at": "2020-10-13T07:18:29Z",
    "body": "And with regards to the bug of the prompt not rerendering in place on mode switching, maybe it's related to fish's [commandline](https://fishshell.com/docs/current/cmds/commandline.html) command. If you want to set the current commandline buffer in fish (so rerender the prompt in place) this is the command you'd use.\r\n\r\nMaybe the bug is related to this somehow? Just an idea, I have no idea how starship interacts exactly with fish shell so I could be way off.",
