    "body": "steps to reproduce:\r\n\r\nin a terminal (where `~/.config/kitty/kitty.conf.sample` is a kitty default config):\r\n```console\r\nkitty --config=~/.config/kitty/kitty.conf.sample sh -c 'env HOME=$(mktemp -d) fish'\r\n```\r\n\r\nin the new kitty window:\r\n```console\r\nfish_vi_key_bindings\r\nstarship init fish --print-full-init | source\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen paste something and / or switch vi mode by pressing `<ESC>`",
